---
import SectionHeading from "./SectionHeading";
import { ArrowRight, BookOpen, MessagesSquare, Wrench } from "lucide-react";
import SetupUtilities from "./SetupUtilities.astro";
import { ProjectRules } from "./ProjectExamples";
---
<SetupUtilities />
<section id="project-rules" class="project-fit" aria-labelledby="project-fit-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="lifecycle-heading"><SectionHeading id="project-fit-title" target="project-rules" level="h2">Make Magpie work your way</SectionHeading></div>
    <ProjectRules />
  </div>
</section>
<section id="learning" class="learn-skills container" aria-labelledby="learn-skills-title">
  <div class="learning-intro">
    <img src="/illustrations/magpie/magpie-standing.png" width="120" height="120" alt="" loading="lazy" />
    <div class="lifecycle-heading">
      <SectionHeading id="learn-skills-title" target="learning" level="h2">Get more out of your agent</SectionHeading>
      <p>Magpie is a place to start learning, too. Explore practical guides for using agents in everyday work, one new skill at a time.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="learning-grid">
    <article class="learning-path">
      <h3><BookOpen aria-hidden="true" /><span>Start with the basics</span></h3>
      <p><strong><q>Where do I even start?</q></strong> Start with how agents use models, tools and context to work through a task.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/docs/education/what-agents-are" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Meet your agent</a>
    </article>
    <article class="learning-path">
      <h3><MessagesSquare aria-hidden="true" /><span>Work better together</span></h3>
      <p><strong><q>I’m getting the hang of this!</q></strong> Give clearer instructions, steer the work and know when to step in.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/docs/education/working-with-agents" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Build good habits</a>
    </article>
    <article class="learning-path">
      <h3><Wrench aria-hidden="true" /><span>Make a skill of your own</span></h3>
      <p><strong><q>I could turn this into a skill!</q></strong> Turn a familiar task into a skill your agent can use again.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/docs/education/your-first-skill" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Try your first skill</a>
    </article>
  </div>
  <div class="section-followup"><a class="button button-soft" href="/docs/education/readme" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><span>Explore the learning guides</span><ArrowRight className="cta-arrow" aria-hidden="true" /></a></div>
</section>
